OL,1,V7w3s7s35B                         G8/24
OL,2,V55555555C16 USA SERVICEMEN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CHURT BY PANAMA BOMB
OL,4,         C
OL,5, A bomb thrown through the window of a
OL,6, Panama City cafe has injured 16 US
OL,7, servicemen and 11 Panamanians.
OL,9, No group has admitted carrying out the
OL,10, attack and Panama police said they knew
OL,11, of no motive.
OL,13, US Defence Secretary Dick Cheney said
OL,14, two bombs or grenades were thrown from
OL,15, passing cars. Most of those taken to
OL,16, hospital had injuries to their legs.
OL,18, The bombing is believed to be the first
OL,19, such attack on US servicemen in Panama
OL,20, since the USA overthrew the government
OL,21, of General Manuel Noriega.
OL,23,F]DFrom 03-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
