OL,2,V55555555CISRAEL 'BACKS USA
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CPEACE PLAN'
OL,5, Israeli premier Yitzhak Shamir is
OL,6, reported to have backed US plans for
OL,7, convening the first-ever Israeli-
OL,8, Palestinian peace talks.
OL,10, Israeli TV said Mr Shamir met with
OL,11, ministers of his Likud bloc at his
OL,12, Jerusalem home to win support for US
OL,13, Secretary of State James Baker's plan.
OL,15, The plan would only require Israel to
OL,16, state its willingness to hold talks in
OL,17, Cairo with Arabs who are residents of
OL,18, the occupied West Bank and Gaza Strip.
OL,20, The Israelis wanted a compromise so
OL,21, that Arabs in annexed East Jerusalem
OL,22, would not be included in the talks.
OL,23,F]DFrom 03-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
